    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 12 Chestnut Crescent, Johnstown Wood, to the market. This well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached home is located in a popular and mature estate in Johnstown, Navan. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises of an entrance hall, living room, open-plan kitchen/dining area, and a guest bathroom. On the first floor, there are three bedrooms, including a very spacious master bedroom with an ensuite, as well as a family bathroom and a hot press. The home also benefits from ample parking and a very large rear garden. This property presents an excellent opportunity to any potential buyer looking for spacious comfortable living.\r\n\r\n12 Chestnut Crescent is located just 3km from Navan Town Centre and is within walking distance of a range of local amenities in Johnstown. Schools such as St. Stephen’s National School, Coláiste na Mí and Loreto Secondary School are all within walking distance. Johnstown Shopping Centre, SuperValu and the IDA Business Park are only a few minutes’ walk from the property. The area provides easy access to the M3 Motorway, placing Dublin City Centre approximately 50 minutes away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Situated in a well regarded estate\r\nQualifies for a green mortgage\r\nThis family home is in walk in condition \r\nVery spacious rear garden \r\nClose to a host of local amenities \r\nLocated within walking distance of all local amenities"
      },
